{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When monsters invade, the giant robot Super Supreme powers up. It\u2019s your job as a scientist to pilot it into battle. Dream Team Supreme combines strategy, discovery, and collaboration in a roguelike deckbuilding game. Defeat monsters in battle, collect more data about their origins and stop them once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Program your giant robot for battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Supreme is armed with a predictive drive that displays the monster\u2019s intentions. Plug your cartridges into the beat sequence, Lock In, and Super Supreme will execute the turn. Playing cartridges is free, it\u2019s the order that determines whether you\u2019re the hero standing tall as a skyscraper or you\u2019ve got a monster-sized footprint on your chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/9a3d7f032b08a00cc88250f0063589f2.poster.avif?t=1764489814\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/9a3d7f032b08a00cc88250f0063589f2.webm?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/9a3d7f032b08a00cc88250f0063589f2.mp4?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play and build 2 decks together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your dream team! It takes 2 scientists to pilot Super Supreme. Each has their own play styles, strengths, and field of studies. There are 10 pairs to start defending the world with and an unreasonable amount of final deck builds. Will you adapt your strategies to take down the monsters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/f4354d489c2b43a87168d530ccdd3456.poster.avif?t=1764489814\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/f4354d489c2b43a87168d530ccdd3456.webm?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/f4354d489c2b43a87168d530ccdd3456.mp4?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover a cast of memorable monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saturday morning cartoon monsters are coming through! Monsters are made from inanimate objects! Monsters are mutated creatures! Monsters are Kaiju! Our heroes are scientists who make piloting Super Supreme feel like taking your favorite toy outside for an adventure in the sun. An adventure with monsters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/497d6436872f17c5f52a43b72309bd49.poster.avif?t=1764489814\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/497d6436872f17c5f52a43b72309bd49.webm?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/497d6436872f17c5f52a43b72309bd49.mp4?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore crunchy new mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Supreme and the monsters you face convert any unused block into momentum, a resource used to power up the next turn\u2019s first attack. Momentum makes the giants feel very heavy indeed and raises the stakes every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the beat sequence with single and dual-sided cartridges. The options are boundless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/52fe24c4ad3017da0391dbd45fa4d5ed.poster.avif?t=1764489814\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/52fe24c4ad3017da0391dbd45fa4d5ed.webm?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/52fe24c4ad3017da0391dbd45fa4d5ed.mp4?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1P or 2P co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two heads are better than one, even when they are both on the same giant robot! Talk through problems and ideas with a friend. Celebrations are more enjoyable and it\u2019s funnier when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/005cfa44f0dce92bfc29992294208d92.poster.avif?t=1764489814\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/005cfa44f0dce92bfc29992294208d92.webm?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/005cfa44f0dce92bfc29992294208d92.mp4?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endlessly replayable</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. The map and rewards change every time you start a new run. Dream Team Supreme is all about discovering new strategies by experimenting with different pairings, trying out new cartridges, and installing powerful mods. Content unlocks as you progress and exponentially increases the number of combos you can play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1b732175c8fb0f479acc1af3e20a2e6.poster.avif?t=1764489814\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1b732175c8fb0f479acc1af3e20a2e6.webm?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1b732175c8fb0f479acc1af3e20a2e6.mp4?t=1764489814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like the scientists that make up Dream Team Supreme, we believe in a strong feedback loop, we believe in testing our hypotheses. We release frequent updates that add features or content. That\u2019s why we organize playtests and seek your feedback. Join the community on Discord to learn the what and when of updates and add your voice to our game development journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208500?t=1764489814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/c7cae53439aa53acdaa4e3f9c72121a68a020f2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764489814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/5d3a5257b4ad4418d9f5316c267254cd888e93d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764489814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/5d3a5257b4ad4418d9f5316c267254cd888e93d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764489814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","